					{
						"Text": ""
					},
					"Key": "TransitionMetalSciencePack/Desc"
				},
				{
					"Source":
					{
						"Text": "An acidic fluid to dissolve the most basic of metals for further metallurgy."
					},
					"Translation":
					{
						"Text": "一种酸性液体，用于溶解最基本的金属，以便进行进一步的冶金加工。"
